there is a level of excellence and a consistency in the quality of the work, not necessarily in a stylistic manner. He is the architect who helped make the multi-style style of Los Angeles. And Los Angeles, in turn, helped make him. In Los Angeles, Paul Williams was able to build a career for himself that he probably couldn't have had
你会发现其中流露出卓越的水准和一以贯之的品质，尽管这并非体现在某种固定的风格上。他正是那个塑造了洛杉矶多元风格的建筑师。而洛杉矶，反过来也成就了他。在洛杉矶，保罗·威廉姆斯得以开创自己的职业生涯，而这作为一名非裔美国建筑师，他在美国其他任何地方

